per have bee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T20:46:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5103720-1843481262705290","game_id":"steam-5103720","kind":"announcement","title":"Tell Me Your Tale Just Got a Major Makeover","summary":"TMT Got a Major Makeover!This update brings several improvements to the Tell Me Your Tale demo, including character visual reworks, new sound effects, new gameplay features, localization fixes, and general polish.Little Red Riding Hood, the Big Bad Wolf, and Bluebeard have received visual reworks, with updated sprites and additional details to better match the current visual direction of the game.Added new sound effects throughout the demo, including audio feedback for the printer and other inte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T18:03:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5103720-1843481262687900","game_id":"steam-5103720","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Fixes and Improvements","summary":"Demo Updates and FixesThis update mainly focuses on bug fixes, visual adjustments, and interface compatibility improvements for the Tell Me Your Tale demo.Fixed an issue in the Rulebook where the Tales and Folklore categories were swapped, causing some information to be displayed incorrectly.Fixed Humpty Dumpty’s old record, which incorrectly classified him as Folklore. The record now displays the correct category.Fixed several visual issues where the blue background could appear in areas that w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T03:36:11Z","time_pr